  "changes": [
    "HQE/QE/E arithmetic organization migrated; source names, ports, widths and packages adapted.",
    "H/Q product primitives migrated; PG-local/word-local alignment removed. A new global 16/32-lane alignment and pipelined natural-width tree is implemented.",
    "All six PE outputs share F=pe_align_width and S11; g2 pads its normalized magnitude by one exact low zero.",
    "Global H/Q sums grow by 4/5 bits, then normalized magnitude is explicitly RTZ by 2/3 bits to the shared output window.",
    "E8M0 Q block exponent is hoisted once per PE; dedicated H/Q unpack paths omit scale-tail multiplication.",
    "No original verification/PPA status is inherited."
  ],
